      "id": "claim_23d2f03bd2fb486f968001dfeeedae76",
      "statement": "main() is the CLI layer: it parses basepath, output_path, --log, --threads, and --dry-run, maps --log to a numeric logging level (raising TypeError for invalid names), calls setup_logging, and invokes sort_images; it exits via sys.exit(1) when sort_images reports failure_count > 0, otherwise exits 0.",
